    {
        "content": "<p>Hello everyone!</p>\n<p>I am looking for my first mathlib contribution so I can get more familiar working with lean in large codebases. </p>\n<p>My experience constitutes of:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Being a fourth year undergrad in Math and Compsci at U of T</li>\n<li>Read \"Mathematics in Lean\" book chapters 1 to 4 inclusive and did exercises</li>\n<li>Read \"Theorem Proving in Lean\" chapters 1 to 5</li>\n<li>Went through \"GlimpseOfLean\" all things in Exercises folder</li>\n</ul>\n<p>My ultimate goal with this is to be more prepared and gain experience coding in lean within large codebases since I am getting started in autoformalization research this summer.</p>\n<p>Please let me know if there are any good first issues I can take on. I noticed on github, that most of the issues are taken, and it was hard to find what I can work on, so I wanted to ask here. Thanks for helping me out!</p>",
        "id": 595209024,
        "sender_full_name": "Tadd Yuchi Mao",
        "timestamp": 1778813087
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Sure about the coding lean in large code bases, but I think you should provide more detail as to the math aspect given its mathlib! </p>\n<p>What areas of math would you be most proficient/interested in, for example?</p>",
        "id": 595209831,
        "sender_full_name": "Yan Yablonovskiy 🇺🇦",
        "timestamp": 1778813686
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>The areas I feel most comfortable with  are real analysis, group theory, and calculus. Secondary choices would include linear algebra, and complex analysis.</p>",
        "id": 595210590,
        "sender_full_name": "Tadd Yuchi Mao",
        "timestamp": 1778814251
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>One potentially interesting project is Burnside’s theorem on solvability of groups of order p^a q^b. It might take a while, though.</p>",
        "id": 595212093,
        "sender_full_name": "Scott Carnahan",
        "timestamp": 1778815287
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"1079161\">Tadd Yuchi Mao</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/113489-new-members/topic/Looking.20for.20first.20contribution.20to.20mathlib/near/595210590\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>group theory</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>idk if you want to just jump in, but AFAIK we're missing these \"trivial\" theorems for the additive group of integers:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Int</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">closure_eq_zmultiples</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℤ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">AddSubgroup</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">closure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">AddSubgroup</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zmultiples</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">gcd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℤ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Int</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">closure_eq_zmultiples_finsetGcd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℤ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">AddSubgroup</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">closure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℤ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">AddSubgroup</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zmultiples</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">gcd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Int</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zmultiples_sup</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℤ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">AddSubgroup</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zmultiples</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⊔</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">AddSubgroup</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zmultiples</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">AddSubgroup</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zmultiples</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">gcd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℤ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Int</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">finsetSup_zmultiples</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℤ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sup</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">AddSubgroup</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zmultiples</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">AddSubgroup</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zmultiples</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">gcd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Int</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zmultiples_inf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℤ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">AddSubgroup</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zmultiples</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⊓</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">AddSubgroup</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zmultiples</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">AddSubgroup</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zmultiples</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lcm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℤ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Int</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">finsetInf_zmultiples</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℤ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">inf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">AddSubgroup</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zmultiples</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">AddSubgroup</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zmultiples</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lcm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 595212286,
