        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"630477\">Scott Carnahan</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/113489-new-members/topic/Looking.20for.20first.20contribution.20to.20mathlib/near/595212093\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>One potentially interesting project is Burnside’s theorem on solvability of groups of order p^a q^b. It might take a while, though.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>I heard this was formalised by an LLM as part of lean-eval. Please don't quote me</p>",
