        "timestamp": 1783959764
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>No way! Is the purpose of the eval site just to see what they are capable of doing or to provide rough drafts which could be refined into something acceptable into mathlib?</p>",
        "id": 610890699,
        "sender_full_name": "Ryan Smith",
        "timestamp": 1784134417
